# PART 2 — MULTI-BOOK BARCODE SCANNER

## 6. Main objective

I want to scan multiple books without having to open and close the scanner for every book.

Currently, the scanner effectively works like this:

1. Open camera.
2. Scan one barcode.
3. Stop the camera.
4. Look up metadata.
5. Manually start another scanning session.

I want a dedicated **Batch Scan** mode.

The user should be able to scan an entire stack of books in one session.

The camera should remain active as books are scanned one after another.

Do not make the user restart the camera after every successful barcode detection.

---

