Inspect these existing files:

- `book-tracker/src/components/AddBookModal.tsx`
- `book-tracker/src/services/scannerAndOcr.ts`
- `book-tracker/src/utils/scanFlow.ts`
- `book-tracker/src/utils/isbn.ts`
- Relevant metadata lookup and book creation services.

There are several important implementation details to investigate.

### Current implementation observations

The existing `scannerAndOcr.ts` uses ZXing WASM and has:

