However, the existing barcode evaluation function returns a single evaluated result rather than a complete collection of detected barcodes.

The live scanner in `AddBookModal.tsx` also sets `scanDetectedRef.current = true`, stops the camera, and immediately starts metadata lookup after the first successful detection.

This behavior must be redesigned for batch scanning.

Do not replace the entire scanner infrastructure unnecessarily. Extend and reuse it.

